Modification notice
-------------------

The distributed artifact is not the untouched upstream ClientJS release file.
It was rebuilt from the upstream `src/client.base.js` entry with the direct
ua-parser-js dependency replaced by version 0.7.41. The resulting browser file
was minified. The exact patched source tree, patched lockfile, webpack config and
build log used for the retained artifact are not present in this repository, so
the current artifact is not claimed to be byte-for-byte reproducible.

